# --- OS / IDE Junk ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
.bin/
*~

# --- Go Binaries and Build Output ---
bin/
*.test

# --- Nix Build Outputs ---
# No trailing slash: 'nix build' creates result as a SYMLINK to the store
# path, and a trailing slash matches only directories, so 'result/'
# ignored nothing nix actually produces. gapi and goblin carried the
# same defect.
result
result-*

# --- Temporary / Runtime State ---
tmp/
*.log

# --- TLS / Private Key Material ---
# UNIFORMITY, not exposure, and worth being honest about which. magelib
# is a build library: 42 tracked files, no certificate generation, no
# key material, and no plausible reason to acquire either.
#
# The patterns match gapi's and goblin's so all four repos can be
# reasoned about as one rule rather than "three have it and magelib was
# judged exempt" - a judgement nobody will remember making.
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.csr
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
